# Both forms are required. `**/node_modules` alone does not exclude the
# repository-root node_modules in the tar packer `az acr build` uses, which
# means a local build silently uploads ~640 MB / 50k+ files as build context
# and appears to hang. The bare entry excludes the root directory; the `**/`
# entry excludes the per-workspace ones.
node_modules
**/node_modules

**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo

# Expo app is out of deploy scope and would dominate the build context.
apps/mobile

.git
.github
infra/terraform/.terraform
infra/terraform/*.tfstate*
infra/terraform/tfplan

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
apps/api/uploads
apps/api/prisma/migrations

**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/coverage
